> ore the start (grouped end included) = 0; p in column p") (r(p))
 71.         gen byte after = !never & year >= gA
 72.         quietly reghdfe y after, absorb(firm_id year) vce(cluster firm_id)
 73.         post `h' ("`e'") (`v') (1) ("twfe") ("own_overall") (.) (_b[after]) (_se[after]) (e(df_r)) (.) (.) (e(N)) (
> "ok") ("one on/off marker from the start year on (the previous paper's two-way model)") (.)
 74.         * As filed: the one regression only (R2-08's gray triangles), to keep the
.         * run time short; the four methods run on the main version.
.         if `v' == 2 {
 75.             display "   [`e' as filed] one regression done"
